1.1 Wa s the data investig ated to identify outliers  and to asse ss distributional p ropertie s
before a nalysis?
1.2 Wa s the result of the in vestigation u sed app ropriately to transform the data an d sele ct
approp riate d ata points?
2. Did studi es carry out a sens itivity or resid ual analy sis?
2.1 We re the resulting e stimation mod els subject to sensitivity or resid ual analy sis?
2.2 Wa s the result of the sensitivity or re sidual analy sis used to re move abno rmal data
points if ne cessary?
3. Were accu racy statistics base d on the  raw data scale?
4. How g ood was the study  compa rison method?
4.1 Wa s the single compa ny selecte d at random (n ot sele cted for convenie nce) from
several different comp anies?
